{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, fling, and cause chaos with your shoes in this physics-based mayhem.\u00a0Play 17 of 50+ levels and try 2 of 3 unique shoes in this demo. Discover secrets, unlock bonus levels and fill your journal with shiny stickers. Master the perfect throw to SHOE IT ALL!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET READY TO SHOE IT ALL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in 17 hand-picked levels from the upcoming full release and master the unique swing-based aiming mechanic that challenges your precision and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783290/extras/0f15c6316b3a56da7dd265aa1ed933be.poster.avif?t=1755007294\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783290/extras/0f15c6316b3a56da7dd265aa1ed933be.webm?t=1755007294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783290/extras/0f15c6316b3a56da7dd265aa1ed933be.mp4?t=1755007294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PURE CHAOS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each throw sends your shoes flying into destructible environments where chain reactions spark wild destruction and hilarious surprises. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783290/extras/7692222088791920ead4bc22e07736c3.poster.avif?t=1755007294\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783290/extras/7692222088791920ead4bc22e07736c3.webm?t=1755007294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783290/extras/7692222088791920ead4bc22e07736c3.mp4?t=1755007294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT IT ALL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect shiny stickers, unlock secret and bonus levels and start filling up your journal with all your wildest shoe-flinging moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783290/extras/a0142dd87bfd626d396e1260d422f400.poster.avif?t=1755007294\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783290/extras/a0142dd87bfd626d396e1260d422f400.webm?t=1755007294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783290/extras/a0142dd87bfd626d396e1260d422f400.mp4?t=1755007294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3783290?t=1755007294","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783290/055b48dbf16a514048a557bdadede43e04904b85/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755007294","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783290/483e1314f70197ee7698c6534b7b80a3ff52b776/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755007294","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783290/483e1314f70197ee7698c6534b7b80a3ff52b776/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755007294","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p